=== comp destructuring (1)
' Comp-Result kann via destructuring auseinandergenommen werden.
DIM nums AS TUPLE
nums = (10, 20, 30)
DIM a AS INTEGER
DIM b AS INTEGER
DIM c AS INTEGER
(a, b, c) = [n + 1 FOR n IN nums]
PRINT a, b, c
--- erwartet
11 21 31

=== comp destructuring (2)
' Comp-Result kann via destructuring auseinandergenommen werden.
DIM nums AS TUPLE
nums = (10, 20, 30)
DIM a AS INTEGER
DIM b AS INTEGER
DIM c AS INTEGER
(a, b, c) = [n + 1 FOR n IN nums]
PRINT a, b, c
--- erwartet
11 21 31

